</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Lord, with Thy Holy Ghost,</l><l>Fill me to the uttermost;</l><l>Be it unto me, O Lord,</l><l>Now, according to Thy word;</l><l>Let the life of Jesus be,</l><l>Ever filling, even me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O Lord, with Thy Holy Ghost,</l><l>Fill me to the uttermost;</l><l>Cleansed and holy, pure and clean,</l><l>Let the life of Christ be seen;</l><l>Hold o’er me Thy gracious sway,</l><l>Every hour of every day.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O Lord, with Thy Holy Ghost,</l><l>Fill me to the uttermost;</l><l>For Thy love, Thy light, Thy grace,</l><l>Just a channel all my days;</l><l>Till my Savior’s face I see,</l><l>Fill me, Lord, fill even me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
